<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Scan <math id="S3.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10{\times}10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10{\times}10</annotation></semantics></math> patches (stride 10); pick minimal <math id="S3.T1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta E" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta E</annotation></semantics></math> (CIE Lab) to target RGB; center a <math id="S3.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="ws{\times}ws" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ws{\times}ws</annotation></semantics></math> window.</span>
</span></span>
