<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Three Stages training hyperparameter</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The specific parameters used in the first stage of training are listed in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Three Stages training hyperparameter ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GUI-Spotlight: Adaptive Iterative Focus Refinement for Enhanced GUI Visual Grounding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. The parameters used in the second and third stage of training are listed in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.1 Three Stages training hyperparameter ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GUI-Spotlight: Adaptive Iterative Focus Refinement for Enhanced GUI Visual Grounding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
