<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Training parameters for algorithmic exploration</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The specific training parameters for algorithmic exploration are listed in Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.2 Training parameters for algorithmic exploration ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GUI-Spotlight: Adaptive Iterative Focus Refinement for Enhanced GUI Visual Grounding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. By default, we use <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=0.2</annotation></semantics></math>. In the <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">clip-higher</span> setting, we set
<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\text{low}}=0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mtext>low</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\text{low}}=0.2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\text{high}}=0.28" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mtext>high</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\text{high}}=0.28</annotation></semantics></math>.
The KL coefficient is <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\mathrm{KL}}=0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\mathrm{KL}}=0.01</annotation></semantics></math> by default,
and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\mathrm{KL}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>KL</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\mathrm{KL}}=0</annotation></semantics></math> in the <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">no-KL</span> ablation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
