<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Training and evaluation details for Experiments</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hardware</span> Experiments were conducted on a multi-GPU server with <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8\texttimes" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>×</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8\texttimes</annotation></semantics></math> NVIDIA H<math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="200" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>200</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">200</annotation></semantics></math> (<math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="144" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>144</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">144</annotation></semantics></math> GB HBM<math id="A1.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math>e each), interconnected via NVLink (NV<math id="A1.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="18" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>18</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">18</annotation></semantics></math> links across all pairs. The GPUs ran with NVIDIA driver <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="575.57.08" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>575.57.08</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">575.57.08</annotation></semantics></math> and CUDA <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="12.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>12.9</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">12.9</annotation></semantics></math> (MIG disabled, persistence mode enabled). The host is a dual-socket AMD EPYC 9454 machine (<math id="A1.SS3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\texttimes 48" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>×</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\texttimes 48</annotation></semantics></math> cores, <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="192" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>192</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">192</annotation></semantics></math> threads total) with  <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.5</annotation></semantics></math> TiB system memory. We conducted all training and evaluation on GPUs <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4–7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>–</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4–7</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameters</span>
The training phase used the same hyperparameters as the three-stage training procedure (Appendix <a href="#A1.SS1" title="A.1 Three Stages training hyperparameter ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GUI-Spotlight: Adaptive Iterative Focus Refinement for Enhanced GUI Visual Grounding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>). For evaluation, we employed the <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">vLLM</span> library; specifically, we set <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">tensor_parallel_size</span>=1, <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpu_memory_utilization</span>=0.95, <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max_model_len</span>=30000, <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max_tokens</span>=19263, <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">temperature</span>=0, <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">top_p</span>=1.0, and a batch size of 64.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompts</span>
We consistently use the following prompt for both training and evaluation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 1: </span>Tool_Prompt</figcaption>
